Demo noindex (kurtbruns/demo.getkestrel.dev#7)

What: public/_headers gains a rule giving every static asset `X-Robots-Tag: noindex`.

Why: no page of the demo should be indexed (DESIGN.md, "The safety property"). The demo
Worker adds the header to every response it makes, but Workers static assets (the
/dashboard editor shell, the favicon) are served before the Worker runs, so their headers
come only from this file.

diff --git a/public/_headers b/public/_headers
index 0210cb8..b618d21 100644
--- a/public/_headers
+++ b/public/_headers
@@ -28,3 +28,9 @@
 /dashboard/*
   X-Frame-Options: DENY
   Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
+
+# Demo sandbox (patched by demo.getkestrel.dev): nothing the demo serves is indexed. The
+# demo Worker sends the same header on every response it makes; this covers the static
+# editor, which the Worker never sees.
+/*
+  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
